Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:31.52,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,The feelings I want to convey from within this light
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:34.97,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Blue Parade, let's jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:52.94,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,The town after the rain, the reflection of the Sun
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:56.53,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H53D1D9&}We align our paces as we follow our dream
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:19:00.37,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HDD6BB7&}I'm sure a new color can also join the mix
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.37,0:19:03.66,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,And then we shine just like a rainbow
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.66,0:19:05.41,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,We reach out our hands
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.41,0:19:07.38,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HDD6BB7&}And the moment they touch
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:09.46,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Our smiles meet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:11.37,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H53D1D9&}I feel so happy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.37,0:19:16.78,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not for someone else, I want to sing for your sake
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.78,0:19:18.44,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,This is my wish
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:22.03,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Shine, shine, under the morning Sun
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:25.89,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Your courage will move you towards your dream
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:28.69,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Twinkle, twinkle, spread it on
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:29.56,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Then the sea will
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.56,0:19:31.46,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Gather all your {\3c&H53D1D9&}hope
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:33.41,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,And shine onto your {\3c&HDD6BB7&}future
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.41,0:19:36.80,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even your {\3c&H53D1D9&}smallest feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:39.03,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HDD6BB7&}Once joined together
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.45,0:19:41.22,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,They become strong
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:45.26,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,And can reach as far as you wish
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.26,0:19:47.42,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:50.79,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Convey it, convey it, up to the night sky
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:54.42,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Your feelings can go beyond the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:57.59,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,And when one, then another, becomes true
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.59,0:19:58.51,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Onto the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:20:00.30,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,You gather all your wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.30,0:20:03.93,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,And draw your own future
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.37,0:20:07.98,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:10.45,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,We all will
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.45,0:20:14.78,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Draw our own
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.78,0:20:17.82,Insert8 Eng,,0,0,0,,Blue Parade
