Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When I open the Mirror Compact,\N I turn into my stylish self with make-up and coords!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Idol Princess: AiPri!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the shining wish that sparkles deep within your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll grant everyone's wishes with our radiant lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.90,0:01:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll grant everyone's wishes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.01,0:02:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish Granting Channel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.68,0:02:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Inori norinori!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.19,0:02:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Love is happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Konomi Inori!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.61,0:02:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.11,0:02:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make your dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Yumemiya Aoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The fourth AiPri Fest!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.23,0:02:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It really was exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumi-chan and Olivia-chan's live was just amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.19,0:02:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Their feelings towards their friends really got conveyed in that live!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.35,0:02:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi-chan's Pure Heart was so beautiful too! \NThey were literally shining!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.14,0:02:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.69,0:02:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The energy in Inori's Smile Heart's performance was also amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prifriends at Onegai Square were all smiles too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortu-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:02:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi, Inori, why did you start without me-chu!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortu! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just chatting with Aoi-chan a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumigumi Stickers of Friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll grant it with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tomosaka Gumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fly through the heavens with wings of courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.19,0:03:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Yuuki Olivia!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.66,0:03:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumi, Olivia, good afternoon-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumigumi good afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Fortu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You have already started, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.84,0:03:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.86,0:03:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We were talking about the fourth AiPri Fest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we were able to grant Nobue-san's wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.03,0:03:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She was thinking a lot about her friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That auntie really was norinori!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.42,0:03:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Koharu-san was also really happy to see that people were even more excited than during the previous AiPri Fest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The AiPri Club really has been helping us a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I also had so much fun performing as a duo with Emma-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She really feels like an older sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.73,0:04:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and when together we got to play games and eat udon together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It was such a happy day!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to eat some too-chu...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.01,0:04:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Inori and Emma-san's duo was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But the third AiPri Fest sure was a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it was a contest between our AiPri Fest and the High Sense Fest, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,To be all norinori, and perform—this is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.43,0:04:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Norinori!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was like Tate Gotou-san's love poems!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,More radiant than the summer sun—my sweet honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll melt—your eyes, they are shaved ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought they'd bring out such a celeb!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.69,0:04:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sango-san really is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nana-chan said that right now he's on a journey to perfect his High Sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The third AiPri Fest started with Nana-chan hyping up the crowd!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.73,0:05:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We all got norinori too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But it sure was difficult to keep up with Nana-chan back when we first met...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.21,0:05:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's part of Nana-san's charm, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohohoho! Did I just hear someone say my name, by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nana-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall make the flames of your passion overcome their limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Atami Nana!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.31,0:05:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The radiant sparkle of hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.40,0:05:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Mochinaga Emma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.95,0:05:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nana and Emma are here too-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.52,0:05:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortu, I brought a present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.52,0:05:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Donutchu-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.06,0:05:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I have also brought drinks for everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.86,0:05:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi, I'm leaving the rest to you-chu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.86,0:05:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost her to the donuts...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.53,0:05:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortu really loves donuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I am very delighted she's enjoying my present.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.66,0:06:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumigumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Nana-chan's birthday the other day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Nana-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.86,0:06:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.48,0:06:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall continue to lead everyone with my passionate High Sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.11,0:06:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohohohoho!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.53,0:06:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta learn with that forward-looking personality of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just forward-looking!\N It's also amazing how she never gives up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We could all see it back when we volunteered to help with fixing those plushies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That day, I realized how kind of a person Nana-san really is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Olivia-chan was also incredible back when she formed a duo with Nana-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Aah, enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.35,0:06:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.85,0:06:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.85,0:06:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumi!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.86,0:06:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You simply don't have the courage, Nana-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.19,0:07:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually want to do it, yet you keep hiding your own feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.11,0:07:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to become much closer friends with you, Nana-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's because I love the cool and passionate AiPri Nana-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, the reason why I said you should have the first live in the AiPri Fest,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.85,0:07:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,is because I think you are incredible, Nana-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How come!? Why!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.05,0:07:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you just understand this!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Alan-niisan praised Nana-san after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He said her passion was High Sense, and reminded him of Sango-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I just did what anyone would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I really could feel my hope grow thanks to Nana-san's passion in that duo live!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I feel like watching that live again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.20,0:07:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, let's watch it-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our live is today's first!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.84,0:08:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A most passionate and High Sense choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How was it to perform with me, Emma-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I could really feel the passion embrace me as you sang, Nana-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I got to sing a song of passionate hope. It was really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.19,0:08:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nana-chan and Emma-chan's High Sense\N was truly norinori on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.19,0:08:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Aoi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was completely... High Sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, definitely!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.38,0:08:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your passion shine even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.53,0:08:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Buzzlume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:09:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane! It's a Buzzlume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.55,0:09:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,May my burning passion reach you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.47,0:09:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Buzzlume Live, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Their Buzzlume Change shines in the hue of passion-pyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was such a fiery Buzzlume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't help but feel captivated by its beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.83,0:10:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nana-san and Emma-san both looked so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohohohoho! That's a given!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.29,0:10:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Emma-san, we just got a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Elp-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Elp-chan doing well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.66,0:10:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She really surprised everyone back then!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.03,0:10:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that a Pricorn that ended up parting ways with Emma-san long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.65,0:10:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,would end up becoming an AiPri and visiting her again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quite an unexpected turn of events, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Inori-san and everyone else has also been working hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.55,0:10:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Like back when Inori-san's friend Mai-chan came visit her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone supported her and helped her look for her penpal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai-chan was all smiles when she finally got to meet Ayaka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep doing my norinori best \Nto bring smiles to all my beloved friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna make my friends smile too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:11:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I also wish to stir up my flames of passion even more, \Nas I aim towards my dream of bringing smiles to everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.04,0:11:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when my grandpa was hospitalized, Gumi-chan and Nana-chan really helped me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.58,0:11:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.95,0:11:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.35,0:11:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I want to convey a \Nnorinori bunch of smiles to Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Through my live!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumi-chan, Nana-chan. Will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.28,0:11:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.02,0:11:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count with my passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of us, together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of them all shared the same wish to make Inori's grandpa smile, and that's what made their live such a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Lady Goddess...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.36,0:11:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.68,0:11:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Our hearts become one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It was our first trio live!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We were all norinori, it was so fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.52,0:12:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We had a ton of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Nana-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.71,0:12:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw something I could never see on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.62,0:12:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Inori and Gumi were both truly High Sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.85,0:12:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Their trio live was so norinori!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Norinori, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.36,0:12:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Make what's deep within your heart shine even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Buzzlume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane! It's a Buzzlume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:13:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,May our bustling hearts reach you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.69,0:13:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Buzzlume Live, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A brand new miraculous trio is born at full-power!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.04,0:13:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I love the dance on this part!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.57,0:13:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.10,0:13:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so happy we could all get norinori like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:13:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumigumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.11,0:14:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Smile Heart's live was incredible, as you would expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And it wasn't just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Aoi-chan and the others also thought on it together,\N and performed a great live as Pure Heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We all tend to be very cautious, so we had a bit of a slow start, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If we are the type to tap a stone bridge many times before crossing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.52,0:14:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nana-san and the others are always racing full steam ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all about facing things with spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Inori racing full steam ahead! Buu-buu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gumi too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Buu-buuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Buu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They really are norinori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.21,0:14:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Art Fest was also really fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough to make me feel jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not going to "buu-buu" with them, Nana-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.73,0:14:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm a High Sense AiPri, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.70,0:14:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, Nana-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.30,0:14:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.36,0:15:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.03,0:15:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Buu-buu...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.03,0:15:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to do our best as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.03,0:15:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.47,0:15:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.20,0:15:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Emma can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.55,0:15:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the six of us will be able to shine hope onto the heart of the Goddess!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.94,0:15:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu-chuchu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.53,0:15:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the first part of today's Wish Granting Channel-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more to come after this-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu-chuchu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all do our best for the second part too-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish Granting Squad, you may continue-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.26,0:15:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the "Poem of the Goddess' Trials", \Nwhich has been passed down in my family for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A heart of passion / The seal of a friend's love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.37,0:15:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A heart of hope / The proof of a dreaming courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.92,0:16:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Six hearts / A single dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.70,0:16:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Goddess' heart / A light of miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So there are trials from the Goddess...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that one must get through them in order to regain the Goddess' power and bring about a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We have found something we must do in order for the Goddess to regain her power!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to start moving towards our dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is to make it so people from all around the world have the most High Sense smiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine is to bring smiles to everyone through the light of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.52,0:16:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be an AiPri who can help people think even more dearly of their friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.45,0:16:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to believe more in my own courage\N and display this in my lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.21,0:16:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I was just thinking about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we perform right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.98,0:16:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the thinking the same too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:17:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's perform as Pure Heart, \Nso that we can grant everyone's dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.19,0:17:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu? Chu-chu!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Chuchu-chuchu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish catchu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Our hearts become one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pure Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.82,0:17:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Coord change, The Castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.69,0:17:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.03,0:17:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's make-up time-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lips!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cologne!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.69,0:17:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine, Onegai Jewel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:17:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Coord change-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.71,0:18:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's coord is Pure Heart Buzzlume!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Its highlight is the aurora-colored crystals that sparkle on the accessories and skirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.50,0:18:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Live stage, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.07,0:18:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my wish-granting live!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will support everyone's feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,courage,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and hope-filled
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,live will now start!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.09,0:18:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Make what's deep within your heart shine even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Buzzlume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.11,0:19:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane! It's a Buzzlume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.14,0:19:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,May our sincere hearts reach you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.60,0:19:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Buzzlume Live, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Their pure feelings reach straight into the hearts of the Prifriends-pyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,With every step, our squad feels more and more united as one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.64,0:20:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.59,0:20:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all doing our norinori best for the sake of our beloved Goddess!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.26,0:20:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I also want to grant many wishes for the sake of the Goddess!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.38,0:20:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my dream! And I will make it true through my lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortu-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.40,0:20:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Onegai Prism-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's an AiPri card-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Angel Sports card-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.00,0:21:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can give my best \Nknowing everyone is here with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going like this, and as our hearts become one, \Nwe will bring about the Goddess' Miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.60,0:21:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, in order for the hearts of the Wish Granting Squad to become one,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall be holding a High Sense tea party!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.27,0:21:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be making matching headbands for everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Will there be d-d-d-donutchu!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.28,0:21:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be bringing snacks with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.94,0:21:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm happy-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.24,0:21:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Emma will be telling everyone's fortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.94,0:21:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you be looking into?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the results of their last test at school...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.18,0:21:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking about AiPri, so let's focus on AiPri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.12,0:22:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time for today's Wish Granting Channel to end-chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.43,0:22:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Already!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.94,0:22:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Prifriends!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Be sure to tune in to the next Wish Granting Channel!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.78,0:22:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Until next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.12,0:22:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.72,0:23:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! I'm Azumin from the Onegai AiPri Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.62,0:23:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The card Aoi got today is the Angel Sports!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.68,0:23:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The wings on this coord look just so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.96,0:24:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pastel blue piece of sports fashion!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay tuned for next episode's card!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.42,0:24:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Yumemiya Aoi!
